1
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,000
[sinister music playing]

2
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,000
-[Gon yelling] Why?
-[rumbling]

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,000
[aura exploding]

4
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,000
because it's not your fight.

5
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:06,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

6
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:37,000
[singer singing in English]

7
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:00,000
[singer singing in English]

8
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:05,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

9
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:06,000
The sunglasses guy
with the really big pipe,

10
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:08,000
you tag along with him, don't you?

11
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:10,000
You want him?

12
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:13,000
Then I suggest that you go out
and look for him.

13
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:17,000
[Cheetu] I know where he is,
but I can't get to him.

14
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:19,000
He controls smoke,

15
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:21,000
and he's hidden himself
behind a smoke screen,

16
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:25,000
and no matter how hard I try,
I just can't get through.

17
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:28,000
I scaled the roof
to see if I could get in from above.

18
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:31,000
Huh?

19
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:34,000
And I just so happened to spot you.

20
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:41,000
Ah, so I'm just a little warm-up
before you reach your real target.

21
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:51,000
I'm feeling very tired today.

22
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:53,000
Huh?

23
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:57,000
Let me have your ear for a moment.

24
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:59,000
For the very first time

25
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:13,000
Well, there'll be lots of time
for you to be shocked

26
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:14,000
when we're through.

27
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:16,000
[sighs]

28
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:19,000
Just how self-centered can you be?

29
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:29,000
Huh?

30
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:31,000
[Zeno] You know, if I were you,

31
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:33,000
I would keep a keen eye on my back.

32
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:37,000
[Cheetu laughs] Yeah, nice try.

33
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:45,000
[explosion]

34
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:52,000
Well…

35
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:56,000
looking wouldn't have helped you
all that much anyway.

36
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:12,000
[Silva] Would you have
preferred I spared him?

37
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:15,000
[Zeno] Hmm? Nah, not really.

38
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:22,000
[Silva] How's Killua doing?

39
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:25,000
[Zeno] Hmm? He's matured.

40
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:30,000
And I have reason to believe
he's removed Illumi's needle.

41
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:37,000
I had quite the bizarre experience.

42
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:41,000
You see, it felt as if
time was being condensed.

43
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:45,000
[Silva] I should take your stories
with a grain of salt, Dad.

44
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:49,000
[suspense music playing]

45
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:56,000
[Killua] Okay.
You and I should be safe here.

46
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:58,000
What's the update?

47
00:05:58,000 --> 00:05:59,000
[exhales]

48
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:02,000
[Meleoron] God's Accomplice, deactivate.

49
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:12,000
Knuckle is gonna keep
running around, avoiding Youpi

50
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:14,000
to try and buy us more time.

51
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:16,000
He's out of his mind!

52
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:17,000
Okay.

53
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:20,000
What's the maximum time
you can use God's Accomplice?

54
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:25,000
The first time, I was so nervous
that I tapped out after just ten seconds,

55
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:27,000
but I've calmed down now.

56
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:30,000
I could go a full minute
if I don't have to move.

57
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:34,000
That's plenty,
'cause all I'm gonna need is one shot.

58
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:39,000
[narrator] Approximately three minutes

59
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:42,000
before Killua raised his finger…

60
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:49,000
Knuckle was in the air.

61
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:12,000
[narrator] Once, he punched out a cop
to help his friend escape

62
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:24,000
He was never caught.

63
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:29,000
[grunts]

64
00:07:29,000 --> 00:07:33,000
[yelling]

65
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:35,000
[narrator] His ability
to maintain his stamina

66
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:39,000
while running at top speed
far outshines that of a cheetah.

67
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:41,000
[imperceptible]

68
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:44,000
Knuckle revealed his presence
to save Shoot

69
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:47,000
and focused his energy
on keeping his enemy distracted.

70
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:58,000
[Knuckle] He stopped chasing me?

71
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:06,000
[Knuckle] Damn. Shoot's in trouble.

72
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:30,000
Youpi could only assume

73
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:33,000
that the King
was still in the throne room.

74
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:34,000
Since he had been assigned

75
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:36,000
to keep watch over the staircase,

76
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:41,000
he also assumed that
two other Royal Guards, Pitou and Pouf,

77
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:43,000
were currently protecting the King.

78
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:47,000
This meant that his main priority
was to keep enemies

79
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:13,000
[gasps]

80
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:24,000
[Knuckle] Shoot!

81
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:27,000
[narrator] Shoot was still alive.

82
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:32,000
Shoot, I…

83
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:35,000
[somber music playing]

84
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:47,000
[Shoot groaning]

85
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:54,000
This guy doesn't even think that…

86
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:58,000
we're worth the effort to try
and kill off.

87
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:08,000
This was an unprecedented
insult to them both,

88
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:16,000
Are Shoot and I

89
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:19,000
nothing more than gnats to him?

90
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:21,000
Is that how it is?

91
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:23,000
Fine then,

92
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:26,000
but you're gonna regret it later,

93
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:28,000
because us gnats

94
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:33,000
are gonna make you go bankrupt
in about ten minutes!

95
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:37,000
Hey, Pouf and Pitou!

96
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:40,000
Hey, are you there?

97
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:46,000
[Knuckle] The boss used
Smoky Jail on the throne room.

98
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:49,000
That must mean that he and Pouf
are in there alone,

99
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:51,000
so the King is somewhere else.

100
00:10:53,000 --> 00:10:54,000
[Menthuthuyoupi] Say something!

101
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:17,000
[groans] Damn it.

102
00:11:17,000 --> 00:11:19,000
[Knuckle gasps]

103
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:24,000
[dramatic music playing]

104
00:11:24,000 --> 00:11:25,000
[narrator] By the time
Knuckle realized

105
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:27,000
that he had made an error,

106
00:11:27,000 --> 00:11:29,000
he had already made another one.

107
00:11:33,000 --> 00:11:35,000
[Knuckle] Youpi's eyes
had met with Shoot's.

108
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:46,000
We knew death
was a possibility going in.

109
00:11:47,000 --> 00:11:49,000
Shoot was right there,

110
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:55,000
[narrator]
When Knuckle imagined

111
00:11:55,000 --> 00:11:57,000
the expression on Youpi's face

112
00:11:57,000 --> 00:11:59,000
as he glanced
at the bloodied Shoot

113
00:11:59,000 --> 00:12:02,000
and walked right past him
on his way to the third floor,

114
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:06,000
he realized that he had made
yet another error.

115
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:10,000
[Shoot] Damn it.

116
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:20,000
And why? For what reason?

117
00:12:23,000 --> 00:12:27,000
For the world? For humanity?

118
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:46,000
There's no way in hell!

119
00:12:48,000 --> 00:12:50,000
This is so unreal.

120
00:12:52,000 --> 00:12:54,000
-[thudding]
-[Shoot groans]

121
00:13:27,000 --> 00:13:30,000
[Shoot] I know that my job right now

122
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:33,000
should be to try and stop Knuckle.

123
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:37,000
"Are you crazy? Don't go."

124
00:13:37,000 --> 00:13:41,000
"Just keep your mouth shut,
and buy more time."

125
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:44,000
That's what I should
be saying to him.

126
00:13:52,000 --> 00:13:56,000
That son of a bitch,
the way he looked at me,

127
00:13:57,000 --> 00:14:00,000
it was like… it was like…

128
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:03,000
I was nothing more than trash!

129
00:14:03,000 --> 00:14:06,000
[crying] When you find him…

130
00:14:07,000 --> 00:14:09,000
punch that bastard for me!

131
00:14:12,000 --> 00:14:13,000
Yeah. I got this.

132
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:17,000
Sorry, Master,

133
00:14:23,000 --> 00:14:27,000
Some things are more important
than saving the world.

134
00:14:29,000 --> 00:14:31,000
[narrator] A brand-new error,

135
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:34,000
the significance
of something important.

136
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:43,000
[suspense music playing]

137
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:02,000
Answer me!

138
00:15:03,000 --> 00:15:05,000
[Morel] Is that Youpi?

139
00:15:05,000 --> 00:15:07,000
No way.

140
00:15:07,000 --> 00:15:09,000
Did Shoot and Knuckle get killed?

141
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:13,000
I hope the old man's doing okay.

142
00:15:33,000 --> 00:15:35,000
We thought we knew
what we were dealing with,

143
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:39,000
but these Royal Guards,
did we miscalculate?

144
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:43,000
I thought our plan
was actually working.

145
00:16:00,000 --> 00:16:02,000
despite these emotions,

146
00:16:02,000 --> 00:16:05,000
the ratio of his conviction
remains unchanged.

147
00:16:06,000 --> 00:16:09,000
Just as I would expect
from a strong warrior.

148
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:11,000
I'm impressed.

149
00:16:12,000 --> 00:16:14,000
However, that constraint

150
00:16:14,000 --> 00:16:17,000
will be what inhibits
your decision making.

151
00:16:20,000 --> 00:16:21,000
[Menthuthuyoupi] Damn it.

152
00:16:22,000 --> 00:16:25,000
Why the hell is Pitou's En gone?

153
00:16:34,000 --> 00:16:37,000
What happened? What's going on?

154
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:43,000
Shut up!

155
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:45,000
[rock music playing]

156
00:16:45,000 --> 00:16:47,000
[Menthuthuyoupi]
The fuzz on my shoulder

157
00:17:02,000 --> 00:17:05,000
But right now,
I have to find the King.

158
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:07,000
What the hell is going on?

159
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:09,000
It's pissing me off!

160
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:33,000
Okay, I've had enough!

161
00:17:34,000 --> 00:17:38,000
What is it with you guys?

162
00:17:46,000 --> 00:17:48,000
It was drastic enough

163
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:51,000
to make Knuckle
instantly turn to flee,

164
00:18:38,000 --> 00:18:39,000
[Shoot groans]

165
00:18:40,000 --> 00:18:41,000
Just hang on.

166
00:18:42,000 --> 00:18:45,000
[Shoot] Did you get him?

167
00:18:45,000 --> 00:18:46,000
Huh?

168
00:19:17,000 --> 00:19:19,000
[narrator] Being under
extreme mental stress

169
00:19:23,000 --> 00:19:27,000
that the true nature
of his ability was in truth

170
00:19:35,000 --> 00:19:37,000
as well as his aura,

171
00:19:37,000 --> 00:19:40,000
become engorged
with his furious rage.

172
00:19:41,000 --> 00:19:43,000
The destruction that was unleashed

173
00:19:43,000 --> 00:19:45,000
was accompanied
by intense pleasure.

174
00:19:46,000 --> 00:19:47,000
Then, as he rapidly deflated,

175
00:19:47,000 --> 00:19:51,000
he was overcome
by a sense of great loss.

176
00:19:54,000 --> 00:19:56,000
Having had more experience,

177
00:19:56,000 --> 00:20:00,000
Knuckle instantly understood
what had happened to Youpi.

178
00:20:07,000 --> 00:20:08,000
I doubt it'll be easy

179
00:20:08,000 --> 00:20:11,000
to goad him into doing that
on purpose

180
00:20:11,000 --> 00:20:13,000
and still make it out unharmed.

181
00:20:15,000 --> 00:20:18,000
It's high-risk, no doubt about it,

182
00:20:18,000 --> 00:20:21,000
but it's an even higher return.

183
00:20:23,000 --> 00:20:26,000
I'll make him mad so he blows up.

184
00:20:27,000 --> 00:20:28,000
I need to get a strike in,

185
00:20:28,000 --> 00:20:31,000
and that'll create
the perfect opportunity,

186
00:20:44,000 --> 00:20:47,000
was close to perfect
for defeating Youpi.

187
00:21:02,000 --> 00:21:05,000
Youpi was trying
desperately to figure out

188
00:21:05,000 --> 00:21:08,000
how to utilize
this self-indulgent ability

189
00:21:08,000 --> 00:21:11,000
in a way that would better
benefit the King.

190
00:21:26,000 --> 00:21:28,000
[Menthuthuyoupi]
The best way I can think of

191
00:21:28,000 --> 00:21:31,000
to serve the King
is to control this fury

192
00:21:32,000 --> 00:21:35,000
without being consumed by emotion.

193
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:38,000
In other words,

194
00:21:50,000 --> 00:21:53,000
the risks were incredibly high.

195
00:21:55,000 --> 00:21:58,000
Three minutes have passed
since the mission began.

196
00:21:58,000 --> 00:22:01,000
[sentimental music playing]

197
00:22:07,000 --> 00:22:10,000
[narrator] Everyone's motives
were beginning to merge.

198
00:22:10,000 --> 00:22:11,000
[closing theme music playing]

199
00:22:11,000 --> 00:22:14,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

200
00:23:30,000 --> 00:23:32,000
[upbeat music playing]

201
00:23:33,000 --> 00:23:35,000
[Gon] Next time, "A False Rage."

202
00:23:35,000 --> 00:23:37,000
[Killua] Yeah? Well, I don't care.

203
00:23:37,000 --> 00:23:39,000
[Gon] Sorry, Killua.

204
00:23:39,000 --> 00:23:40,000
[Killua] I'll never forgive you.

205
00:23:40,000 --> 00:23:41,000
[Gon] Here, have a Choco Robo!

206
00:23:41,000 --> 00:23:42,000
[Killua] Forgiven!

207
00:23:45,000 --> 00:23:47,000
[singer singing in Japanese]
